# TUSKWIND: in the air, holding A again flaps the flippers: a push that
# way the pad points (straight up with the pad alone), never climbing
# faster than a slow rise. Each frame of flapping costs stamina from the
# yellow bar (a full bar is four seconds); with the bar empty he just
# follows his jump. Landing gives none of it back; only sprats do, a
# quarter of the bar each, at once, in the air too.
game tuskwind
wait 20
cheat journey
wait 2
cheat blank
cheat aim 90
wait 2
hold A 62
wait 1
expect mode == 1
waituntil vy10 >= -17 60
hold A 30
expect flapping == 1
expect vy10 == -18
expect stamina == 420
# the pad steers the flap
hold A+RIGHT 20
expect vx10 > 0
expect stamina == 380
hold A+LEFT 40
expect vx10 < 0
expect stamina == 300
# with the bar empty nothing happens
cheat stamina 6
hold A 10
expect stamina == 0
expect flapping == 0
expect vy10 > -18
waituntil mode == 0 300
expect stamina == 0
# a sprat: a quarter of the bar, even in the air
cheat place 0 140
cheat pos 140 160
cheat spawn 3 140 150
wait 1
expect stamina == 120
expect count_3 == 0
waituntil mode == 0 200
expect stamina == 120
# a full bar flaps for four seconds and no more
cheat stamina 480
cheat aim 90
wait 2
hold A 62
wait 1
hold A 300
expect stamina == 0
